        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>These verdant chocobos are quick to hide when attacked, taking the time to recover and retaliate with a vicious ambush from the dense foliage they live around. - Manly Man</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 12, flat-footed 18 (+3 Dex, +9 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 92 [128] (8d10+48)</p><p>Fort +12 Ref +9 Will +6</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 70 ft., climb 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +15 (1d8+8), 2 talons +15 (1d6+8)</p><p>Space 10 ft. Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Choco Wind</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 26, Dex 16, Con 23, Int 2, Wis 18, Cha 10</p><p>Base Atk +8; CMB +17; CMD 30</p><p>Feats Endurance, Run, Improved Initiative, Ability Focus (choco wind)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +9, Climb +16, Perception +13, Stealth +17, Survival +8</p><p>SQ camouflage, choco cure, choco esuna, stealth</p>"
